    "reviews": "\u201cFata Deum is a god game with Black &amp; White vibes.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cOut of all the god games that have sprung up over the last couple decades, Fata Deum is the one that definitely looks to capture something I didn\u2019t know I was needing.\u201d<br>PCGamesN<br>",
